OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigators to use DNA testing
OL,4,Ato identify dogs in livestock attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains an image
OL,7,Fof an injured sheep
OL,9,FDNA testing will be used to track down
OL,10,Fdogs that have attacked livestock.
OL,12,FA change in the law in March has given
OL,13,Fpolice the power to take samples from
OL,14,Fdogs, and dog owners can receive an
OL,15,Funlimited fine if their pets have been
OL,16,Finvolved in any attacks.
OL,18,FFarmers are also being given testing
OL,19,Fkits as part of a project to make sure
OL,20,Fbetter DNA evidence is being gathered.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
